# Hand-labeled aspect labels for the 510 distinct "People Say" tags.
# Labeled by reading each tag; NOT derived from the keyword rules in main.ipynb.
# Aspects: F food, S service, A ambience (place, decor, music, crowd, seating, cleanliness),
#          V value (price, portions-for-money), D delivery and packaging, O other / not about one aspect.
# Conventions: generic "place/spot/venue" -> A; generic "restaurant/hotel/loved it" -> O;
#              portion or quantity -> F; hygienic food -> F; hygienic or clean place -> A.
